{{harvnb|Shenhav|2019|p=49}};

{{harvnb|Manna|2013|p=93}};

{{harvnb|Masalha|2012|pp=5, 107, and 117}}</ref> Israel has been accused of carrying out [[forced displacement]] ([[ethnic cleansing]]),{{sfn|Reynolds|2017|pp=v–vi}}{{sfn|Nofal|Al Tahhan|2023}}<ref name="750k2"/> [[looting]],<ref>{{harvnb|Sabbagh-Khoury|2023|pp=36, 44, 163, 169–177, 183, 186–189, 226–236, 241, 247–251, 256, 265}};

{{harvnb|Sayigh|2023|pp=281–282}};

{{harvnb|Manna|2022|pp=49, 83, 152, 169–170, 174–176, 182, 201, 287 n. 2, 316 n. 26}};

